   "text": "<div data-bbox=\"[19,12,316,23]\" data-label=\"Page-header\" data-id=\"e1\">\nHarbour Energy - Market Update Q3 2026\n</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[19,54,414,80]\" data-label=\"Title\" data-id=\"e2\">\n\n# Market Update Q3 2026\n\n</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[19,94,981,124]\" data-label=\"Text\" data-id=\"e3\">\nDemand held up in the third quarter. The chart and the table below show revenue for each region in 2025 and 2026, and the second page shows how energy costs moved.\n</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[19,147,127,165]\" data-label=\"Section-header\" data-id=\"e4\">\n\n## Revenue\n\n</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[160,189,851,453]\" data-label=\"Chart\" data-id=\"e5\" data-chart-type=\"bar\">\n<table>\n<caption>Revenue by region (EUR m)</caption>\n<tr><th>Region</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr>\n<tr><td>North</td><td>38.5</td><td>42.1</td></tr>\n<tr><td>South</td><td>29.0</td><td>31.0</td></tr>\n<tr><td>East</td><td>24.1</td><td>28.4</td></tr>\n<tr><td>West</td><td>36.2</td><td>35.7</td></tr>\n</table>\nlight: 2025 dark: 2026\n</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[102,471,463,484]\" data-label=\"Caption\" data-id=\"e6\" data-caption-of=\"e5\">\n\n*Figure 1: Revenue by region, 2025 and 2026.*\n\n</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[102,503,398,516]\" data-label=\"Caption\" data-id=\"e7\" data-caption-of=\"e8\">\n\n*Table 1: Revenue by region (EUR m)*\n\n</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[101,521,899,627]\" data-label=\"Table\" data-id=\"e8\">\n<table>\n<tr><th>Region</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr>\n<tr><td>North</td><td>38.5</td><td>42.1</td></tr>\n<tr><td>South</td><td>29.0</td><td>31.0</td></tr>\n<tr><td>East</td><td>24.1</td><td>28.4</td></tr>\n<tr><td>West</td><td>36.2</td><td>35.7</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[495,979,505,990]\" data-label=\"Page-footer\" data-id=\"e9\">\n1\n</div>"
