   "text": "<div data-bbox=\"[19,12,321,23]\" data-label=\"Page-header\" data-id=\"e1\">Harbour Energy - Market Update Q3 2026</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[19,54,185,72]\" data-label=\"Section-header\" data-id=\"e2\">\n\n## Energy costs\n\n</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[19,81,982,111]\" data-label=\"Text\" data-id=\"e3\">Energy costs rose in the summer and eased in September. The line chart shows the monthly cost per tonne moved.</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[127,141,892,413]\" data-label=\"Chart\" data-id=\"e4\" data-chart-type=\"line\">\n<table>\n<caption>Energy cost per tonne (EUR)</caption>\n<tr><th></th><th>Energy</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Apr</td><td>11.2</td></tr>\n<tr><td>May</td><td>12.0</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Jun</td><td>13.8</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Jul</td><td>15.1</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Aug</td><td>14.6</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Sep</td><td>12.9</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[104,433,489,446]\" data-label=\"Caption\" data-id=\"e5\" data-caption-of=\"e4\">*Figure 2: Monthly energy cost per tonne moved.*</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[19,468,704,483]\" data-label=\"Text\" data-id=\"e6\">We expect costs to stay close to the September level for the rest of the year.</div>\n\n<div data-bbox=\"[502,979,512,989]\" data-label=\"Page-footer\" data-id=\"e7\">2</div>"
